📝 README.md File Banane ke Git Commands
Bhai, neeche exact commands hain jo tu apne terminal mein chalayega. Pehle README content banayenge, phir GitHub pe push karenge.

🎯 STEP-BY-STEP COMMANDS
STEP 1: Project folder mein jao
bash
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-knowledge-discovery-agent
STEP 2: README.md file create karo (PowerShell mein)
Option A: Notepad se kholo aur content paste karo

bash
notepad README.md
Phir Notepad mein content paste kar (neeche diya hai), save kar (Ctrl+S), close kar.

Option B: VS Code se kholo

bash
code README.md
Option C: Command line se directly likh (PowerShell)

bash
echo "# AI Enterprise Knowledge Discovery Agent" > README.md
STEP 3: File check karo (optional)
bash
dir README.md
Ya:

bash
type README.md
STEP 4: Git mein add karo
bash
