Tune .gitignore mein !.env.example likha hai — matlab:

.env ❌ ignore hoga (secret)

.env.example ✅ track hoga (template)

Ye best practice hai.

2. .gitkeep files track karni hain
text
!data/uploads/.gitkeep
!database/chroma/.gitkeep
Matlab empty folders GitHub pe rahenge (kyunki Git empty folders track nahi karta).

3. Abhi tak jo .env aur .db push ho gaye hain, unko remove karna hai
Ye commands chala:

bash
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached database/sqlite/app.db
Phir:

bash
git commit -m "chore: remove sensitive files from tracking"
git push origin main
🔍 VERIFY KARNE KE LIYE
Push ke baad GitHub pe jaa ke check kar:

.env file dikhni nahi chahiye ✅

app.db dikhni nahi chahiye ✅

.env.example dikhni chahiye ✅

📋 COMPLETE COMMANDS (One-Shot)
bash
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-knowledge-discovery-agent
notepad .gitignore
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached database/sqlite/app.db
git add .gitignore
git add .
git commit -m "chore: add .gitignore and remove sensitive files"
git push origin main
🎯 FINAL CHECK
bash
git status
