1. .env.example file ko TRACK karna hai
Tune .gitignore mein !.env.example likha hai — matlab:

.env ❌ ignore hoga (secret)

.env.example ✅ track hoga (template)

Ye best practice hai.

2. .gitkeep files track karni hain
text
!data/uploads/.gitkeep
!database/chroma/.gitkeep
Matlab empty folders GitHub pe rahenge (kyunki Git empty folders track nahi karta).

3. Abhi tak jo .env aur .db push ho gaye hain, unko remove karna hai
Ye commands chala:

bash
git rm --cached backend/.env
