📝 .gitignore File Banane ke Git Commands
Bhai, neeche exact commands aur .gitignore ka content de raha hoon. Ye file bahut important hai — isse sensitive files aur unnecessary folders GitHub pe upload nahi honge.

🎯 STEP-BY-STEP COMMANDS
STEP 1: Project folder mein jao
bash
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-knowledge-discovery-agent
STEP 2: .gitignore file banao
bash
notepad .gitignore
Ya VS Code se:

bash
code .gitignore
STEP 3: Content paste karo (neeche diya hai), save karo
STEP 4: Git mein add karo
bash
git add .gitignore
STEP 5: Commit karo
bash
git commit -m "chore: add .gitignore"
STEP 6: GitHub pe push karo
bash
git push origin main
